  "description": "Stand out at the skatepark or in the neighborhood with the 20\" Kent Shimmer BMX Bike, a truly shimmering ride. Designed with a geometric sparkly frame, the Shimmer brings sparkle to every cruise. Even the spokes have sparkle, making this BMX bike unlike anything else on the block. Built with a durable steel frame and fork, the Shimmer is tough and built to last. The 20\" wheels paired with BMX-ready tires deliver control and grip, while the front & rear hand brakes provide great stopping power. The deluxe padded saddle is height adjustable, while the BMX-style handlebar is angle adjustable, allowing for the perfect fit. Front pegs add to the cool factor. Perfect for riders ages 7 - 13, the Kent Shimmer BMX is more than just a bike; it’s a statement. This kids BMX bike is built to perform and guaranteed to stand out.\n\nYou can find this bike exclusively at Walmart!",
